    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Spring Initializr API provides programmatic access to project generation for Spring Boot applications. It exposes metadata about available dependencies, build systems, languages, and Java versions, as well as an endpoint to generate project archives (ZIP) with the selected configuration.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Spring Team",
